{
    "title": "Merrick Bank Mobile",
    "description": "The updated - and totally free - Merrick Bank goMobile app gives you the power to do even more, right from your smartphone. You can check your account balance, schedule and view your payments, view your account transaction details, set up notifications \u2014 and lots more.\r\n\r\nPlus, with our latest update, you can now check and monitor your FICO\u00ae Score with goScore\u00ae so you can stay on top of your credit and avoid surprises. You can also view your monthly billing statement. Get all the details you need to manage your account, plus a fresh new look, by downloading the updated mobile app!\r\n\r\nThe Merrick Bank goMobile app is optimized for your Android\u2122 and is available 24/7 to all Merrick Bank customers. Our App allows you to access your account using your existing online Cardholder Center username and password.\r\n\r\nGet Started:\r\n\r\nTo start using the mobile app, simply use your current online Cardholder Center login information. Note, if you are not enrolled in the Cardholder Center, you will need to do so from your desktop at www.merrickbank.com/cardholdercenter  \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Fingerprint ID\r\n- Quick View\r\n- Set and Schedule Payments\r\n- View your FICO\u00ae Score with goScore\u00ae\r\n- Alert Set-Up & Management\r\n- Recent Transactions\r\n- Payment History\r\n- And much more\r\n\r\nSecurity:\r\nWe take security very seriously. We protect your information through various security controls, including device recognition technology and encrypted mobile banking data, to name a few.\r\n\r\nAndroid\u2122 is a registered trademark of Google Inc.\r\nNote: There is no charge from Merrick Bank for the goMobile App, but message and data rates may apply. Please check with your mobile carrier regarding any web browser/data usage rates on your device.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The updated - and totally free - Merrick Bank goMobile app gives you the power to do even more, right from your smartphone. You can check your account balance, schedule and view your payments, view your account transaction details, set up notifications \u2014 and lots more.<br><br>Plus, with our latest update, you can now check and monitor your FICO\u00ae Score with goScore\u00ae so you can stay on top of your credit and avoid surprises. You can also view your monthly billing statement. Get all the details you need to manage your account, plus a fresh new look, by downloading the updated mobile app!<br><br>The Merrick Bank goMobile app is optimized for your Android\u2122 and is available 24/7 to all Merrick Bank customers. Our App allows you to access your account using your existing online Cardholder Center username and password.<br><br>Get Started:<br><br>To start using the mobile app, simply use your current online Cardholder Center login information. Note, if you are not enrolled in the Cardholder Center, you will need to do so from your desktop at www.merrickbank.com/cardholdercenter  <br><br>Features:<br>- Fingerprint ID<br>- Quick View<br>- Set and Schedule Payments<br>- View your FICO\u00ae Score with goScore\u00ae<br>- Alert Set-Up &amp; Management<br>- Recent Transactions<br>- Payment History<br>- And much more<br><br>Security:<br>We take security very seriously. We protect your information through various security controls, including device recognition technology and encrypted mobile banking data, to name a few.<br><br>Android\u2122 is a registered trademark of Google Inc.<br>Note: There is no charge from Merrick Bank for the goMobile App, but message and data rates may apply. Please check with your mobile carrier regarding any web browser/data usage rates on your device.",
